[00:08.18] All but the truth - forget
[00:13.83] And from this union cup
[00:15.73] We will drink wine tonight
[00:18.94] Qiyamat qiyamat a tawil'
[00:21.47] Qiyamat qiyamat insan al kamel
[00:34.48] Haqiqat itself is drunk
[00:39.59] So drinks the Hidden Imam
[00:47.69] Pride of the peacock angel
[00:52.23] Under the feather veils
[01:09.52] Dark tresses under the black light
[02:14.68] 